tart of the target's turn, as long as the target remains in the Vacuum.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," (DC 10):"]}," The character holds his or her breath for 1 round, reducing the Vacuum's attack roll by 10. Each round the character holds his or her breath in this manner, the check DC increases by 2."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," A Vacuum succeeds automatically against an unconscious target, dealing cumulative d6 damage (1d6 the first round, 2d6 the second, 3d6 the third, and so on). If an unconscious target takes damage equal to or exceeding their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", they die. Additionally, a creature cannot move back up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," until it is returned to a breathable atmosphere.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
